## Attribution & Acknowledgements

- **Curated External Reference Links (`engyasin/awesome-mechatronics`):** Portions of the supporting reference library (`resources/textbooks-and-papers.md`, `resources/open-source-toolchains.md`, and `resources/lab-workbench-bom.md`) incorporate and expand upon curated community links from [`engyasin/awesome-mechatronics`](https://github.com/engyasin/awesome-mechatronics) by Yasin (`@engyasin`) and contributors.
- **Open-Source Simulators & Textbooks Cited:** We gratefully acknowledge the authors of *Modern Robotics* (Kevin M. Lynch & Frank C. Park, Northwestern University), *Feedback Systems* (Karl J. Åström & Richard M. Murray), *Underactuated Robotics* (Russ Tedrake, MIT), Paul Falstad (`falstad.com/circuit`), Wokwi (`wokwi.com`), futurecoder (`futurecoder.io` by Alex Hall), CS50P (David J. Malan, Harvard University), and SparkFun Electronics (`learn.sparkfun.com`, CC BY-SA 4.0 tutorials linked externally).

